---
import TreatmentLayout from '../../components/TreatmentLayout.astro';
import PriceBlock from '../../components/PriceBlock.astro';
import { headMassage } from '../../data/services';
---

<TreatmentLayout
  title="Head Massage"
  metaTitle="Indian Head Massage"
  description="Indian Head Massage at Maison Coiffure: €39 for 30 minutes or €55 for 45 minutes of unhurried attention for the scalp, temples, neck and shoulders."
  lede="A relaxing massage for the scalp, temples, neck and upper shoulders."
  waMessage="Hello Maison Coiffure, I would like to book an Indian Head Massage."
>
  <p>
    An Indian Head Massage helps release tension and create a deep sense of calm. In the quiet of a
    small home salon, without rows of chairs or background bustle, half an hour of focused attention
    can do a remarkable amount.
  </p>
  <p>
    The extended massage allows more time for the neck and shoulders, where most of us hold the
    day's tension. Both versions combine beautifully with a haircut or treatment in the same visit.
  </p>

  <Fragment slot="after">
    <PriceBlock group={headMassage} headingLevel="h2" />
  </Fragment>
</TreatmentLayout>
